Source: neovim
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 cmake,
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 gcc,
 ninja-build,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: neovim
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: heavily refactored vim fork
 Neovim is a fork of Vim focused on modern code and features, extensibility,
 and simplified maintenance. This build compiles neovim from upstream source
 with its bundled dependencies (LuaJIT, libuv, tree-sitter, ...) so it
 installs and runs independently of the suite's library versions.
